      "description": "White field on the concourse; ink border and amber ring on focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-field-label\">Nome del viaggio</span><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"Lisbona aprile 2027\"></label>",
      "css": ":host{--color-brand-500:#ffb000;--color-brand-300:#ffc840;--color-board:#0e0f11;--color-board-cell:#191b1f;--color-board-frame:#2a2d31;--color-board-text:#f2f2f0;--color-board-dim:#9a9ea5;--color-ink:#0e0f11;--color-danger:#c4161c;--color-surface:#fff;--color-line:#d2d5d8;font-family:'Archivo Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:320px}.ds-field-label{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink)}.ds-input{height:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgb(14 15 17 / 0.2);background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);font:inherit;font-size:16px;transition:border-color 150ms,box-shadow 150ms}.ds-input:hover{border-color:rgb(14 15 17 / 0.4)}.ds-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--color-ink);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--color-brand-500)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Nav Strip",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "button-action",
      "description": "Black 56px strip, flap wordmark left, amber bar under the active link, one amber action.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><span class=\"ds-flap ds-flap-sm ds-logo\"><span class=\"ds-flap-cell\"><span>T</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell\"><span>R</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell\"><span>A</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell\"><span>V</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell\"><span>E</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell\"><span>L</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell ds-io\"><span>I</span></span><span class=\"ds-flap-cell ds-io\"><span>O</span></span></span><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#\">Esplora</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#\">I miei viaggi</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#\">Ispirazione</a><button class=\"ds-nav-cta\">Crea viaggio</button></nav>",
      "css": ":host{--color-brand-500:#ffb000;--color-brand-300:#ffc840;--color-board:#0e0f11;--color-board-cell:#191b1f;--color-board-frame:#2a2d31;--color-board-text:#f2f2f0;--color-board-dim:#9a9ea5;--color-ink:#0e0f11;--color-danger:#c4161c;--color-surface:#fff;--color-line:#d2d5d8;font-family:'Archivo Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-flap{display:inline-flex;gap:0.08em;font-stretch:70%;font-weight:650;text-transform:uppercase;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:0}.ds-flap-cell{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:0.74em;height:1.08em;background:var(--color-board-cell);border-radius:2px;color:var(--color-board-text);line-height:1;letter-spacing:0}.ds-flap-cell::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset-inline:0;top:50%;height:1px;background:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.75)}.ds-flap-sm .ds-flap-cell::after{display:none}.ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;height:56px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--color-board);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-board-frame);color:var(--color-board-text)}.ds-logo{font-size:14px}.ds-io{background:var(--color-brand-500);color:var(--color-ink)}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;height:56px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-board-dim);text-decoration:none}.ds-nav-link:hover{color:var(--color-board-text)}.ds-nav-link[aria-current]{color:var(--color-board-text);box-shadow:inset 0 -3px 0 var(--color-brand-500)}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-ink);outline-offset:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--color-brand-500);}.ds-nav-cta{margin-left:auto;height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:none;border-radius:4px;background:var(--color-brand-500);color:var(--color-ink);font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-cta:hover{background:var(--color-brand-300)}"
    },
